 new recruit in a small team of hackers, your mission is to infiltrate XE_CORP's archive database and retrieve vital information for the Edenite Rebellion, crucial to its survival.\n\n# Third-Person Gameplay\n{663687826393284}\nUse classic third-person controls to move your character around, attack, enemies and interact with objects. Collect all the keys to open the door and complete each cipher.\n\n# First-Person Gameplay\n{1327023925018371}\nSometimes your character may need a little help. Reach into the cipher with your controllers to move platforms. Also you can stun enemies to make the fighting a little easier.\n\n# Editor\n{1009083324695992}\nCreate and play your own ciphers using the built-in editor.\n\n*A note on legacy headset support:\nPlease note, versions of Neon Cipher for Meta Quest 2 and Pro are still in development. We hope to bring them to you as soon as we can!", "short_description": "Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path."}]}, "developer_name": "eXomorph Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exomorph.games/privacy-neon-cipher", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "eXomorph Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://exomorph.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_